# Daretti, Rocketeer Engineer: "Whenever Daretti enters or attacks, choose target artifact card in your graveyard. You may sacrifice an
# artifact. If you do, return the chosen card to the battlefield." (CR 603.3d, 701.21a). Turn 3 Bot1 sacrifices both Black Lotuses for mana
# and Lightning Bolts Bot2, so Bot1's graveyard holds two Lotuses and a Bolt while Bot2's holds its own sacrificed Lotus. Daretti
# (not an artifact) enters: the Bolt (not an artifact card) and Bot2's Lotus (not Bot1's graveyard) are refused as the target, a Lotus of
# Bot1's is accepted; Daretti himself is refused as the sacrifice, so is sacrificing two artifacts (Mox Jet and Mox Emerald) for "an artifact", and sacrificing the one Mox Jet returns the Lotus.

